# Admin theme — Phase 1 + Phase 2 guardrails

## Source of truth

- Tokens + rules: `admin.voxbulk.com/adim-web/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`
- CSS: `admin.voxbulk.com/adim-web/src/styles/design-system.css` (`--ds-*`)
- Shared components: `admin.voxbulk.com/adim-web/src/components/ui/`
- Visual reference: `telynx-settings-hub-main` (OKLCH palette, density)

## Phase 1 (done)

- Shell chrome: Sidebar/Topbar tokens/density.
- Home Dashboard rebuilt to reference `/dashboard`.
- Foundation: Button, Table, Tabs, Card/Panel, Badge, KpiCard, Progress, Separator, Sparkline.

## Phase 2 (done — chrome + tokens)

| Batch | Status |
|-------|--------|
| A Analytics, org detail/zones, campaigns, testers | Done (full ui) |
| B OnboardingServices, OrganisationProfile, OCC | Done (OCC structure kept; tokens + error chrome; Profile on ui) |
| C Operations | Done (full or hybrid + CSS token map) |
| D Compliance / Team / Legal / Meeting room | Done |
| E Billing / Pricing | Done (frame + pages; ProductsHub token map only) |
| F Dedicated islands | Done (CSS `--ds-*` token map; JSX islands kept) |

Heavy island JSX (Support Disk, AI Team, Sales Team, Telnyx hub, WA Templates Hub) stays structural — palette now follows design-system. Further full JSX rewrites are optional follow-ups, not Phase 2 blockers.

## Rules for new / touched admin UI

1. **Use `components/ui` + design-system tokens only** — no new page-local palettes, hex colors, or one-off button/table CSS.
2. **Do not invent tokens** — if something is missing, add it to `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` + `design-system.css` first.
3. **Do not create new theme islands.**
4. Keep existing **Sidebar + Topbar shell** (nav/RBAC/search).
5. Visual/structural changes only unless the task explicitly changes logic/API.

## Legacy CSS

`styles.css` still powers residual unmigrated markup. Prefer Tailwind/`components/ui` on new work; do not expand legacy class islands.
